<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>WHY? — Manga</title>

<style>
* {
  box-sizing: border-box;
}

body {
  margin: 0;
  background: #08090d;
  color: white;
  font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
}

header {
  text-align: center;
  padding: 35px 15px;
  background: #121722;
  border-bottom: 2px solid #444;
}

header h1 {
  font-size: 65px;
  margin: 5px;
  letter-spacing: 12px;
}

header p {
  color: #c2c8d4;
}

main {
  max-width: 850px;
  margin: auto;
  padding: 18px;
}

.page {
  display: none;
}

.page.active {
  display: block;
}

.page h2 {
  border-bottom: 1px solid #555;
  padding-bottom: 10px;
}

.panel {
  position: relative;
  min-height: 190px;
  padding: 14px;
  margin: 12px 0;
  border: 3px solid white;
  background:
    repeating-linear-gradient(
      125deg,
      #eeeeee 0px,
      #eeeeee 18px,
      #b8bec8 19px,
      #eeeeee 21px
    );
  color: black;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  justify-content: space-between;
  overflow: hidden;
}

.panel.wide {
  min-height: 250px;
}

.panel.dark {
  background:
    repeating-linear-gradient(
      120deg,
      #111 0px,
      #111 18px,
      #303744 19px,
      #111 22px
    );
  color: white;
}

.label {
  background: black;
  color: white;
  padding: 5px 8px;
  width: fit-content;
  font-size: 11px;
  letter-spacing: 1px;
}

.caption {
  background: white;
  color: black;
  border: 2px solid black;
  padding: 10px;
  font-weight: bold;
}

.bubble {
  align-self: flex-end;
  background: white;
  color: black;
  border: 2px solid black;
  border-radius: 20px 20px 20px 4px;
  padding: 10px;
  max-width: 90%;
  font-weight: bold;
}

.translation {
  color: #b8c0ce;
  font-size: 14px;
  line-height: 1.7;
}

.controls {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 8px;
  margin: 18px 0;
}

button {
  background: #202a3b;
  color: white;
  border: 1px solid #65718a;
  padding: 12px;
  border-radius: 8px;
  cursor: pointer;
}

button:disabled {
  opacity: 0.35;
  cursor: not-allowed;
}

footer {
  text-align: center;
  padding: 25px;
  color: #999;
  border-top: 1px solid #444;
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<header>
  <p>AN ORIGINAL SCI-FI MANGA</p>
  <h1>WHY?</h1>
  <p>
    When everyone had an answer,<br>
    one man dared to ask why.
  </p>
  <p>Near-future Kerala · 2047</p>
  <p>Sci-Fi · Thriller · Mystery · Philosophy</p>
</header>

<main>

<div class="controls">
  <button id="previous" onclick="changePage(-1)">
    ← Previous
  </button>

  <span id="counter">Page 1 / 6</span>

  <button id="next" onclick="changePage(1)">
    Next →
  </button>
</div>

<!-- PAGE 1 -->

<section class="page active">
<h2>PROLOGUE — 2047</h2>

<div class="panel wide">
  <span class="label">PANEL 1 · WIDE SHOT</span>
  <div class="caption">
    2047. Kerala had changed.
  </div>
</div>

<div class="panel">
  <span class="label">PANEL 2 · CITY</span>
  <div class="caption">
    Puthiya nagarangal uyarnnu.
    Pazhaya gramangal nagarangalayi maari.
  </div>
</div>

<div class="panel dark">
  <span class="label">PANEL 3 · SPACE</span>
  <div class="caption">
    Manushyar chandranilekkum
    chovvayilekkum yaathra cheyyan thudangi.
  </div>
</div>

<p class="translation">
  New cities rose. Old villages became cities.
  Humans began travelling to the Moon and Mars.
</p>
</section>

<!-- PAGE 2 -->

<section class="page">
<h2>THE NEW WORLD</h2>

<div class="panel wide">
  <span class="label">PANEL 1 · FUTURISTIC CITY</span>
  <div class="caption">
    Artificial Intelligence manushyarude
    dainandina jeevithathinte bhaagamaayi.
  </div>
</div>

<div class="panel">
  <span class="label">PANEL 2 · CLOSE-UP</span>
  <div class="caption">
    Machines could answer almost anything.
  </div>
</div>

<div class="panel dark">
  <span class="label">PANEL 3 · SILENCE</span>
  <div class="bubble">Pakshe…</div>
  <div class="caption">
    One thing had not changed.
  </div>
</div>

<p class="translation">
  Artificial intelligence became part of everyday life.
  But one thing remained unchanged.
</p>
</section>

<!-- PAGE 3 -->

<section class="page">
<h2>WHAT NEVER CHANGED</h2>

<div class="panel wide">
  <span class="label">PANEL 1 · GENERATIONS</span>
  <div class="caption">
    Manushyarude vishwasangal.
  </div>
</div>

<div class="panel">
  <span class="label">PANEL 2 · THE PAST</span>
  <div class="caption">
    Aayirakkanakkina varshangalayi
    kaimaarikkondirunna kathakalum vishwasangalum…
  </div>
</div>

<div class="panel dark">
  <span class="label">PANEL 3 · GENERATION TO GENERATION</span>
  <div class="caption">
    Oro thalamurayum adutha thalamuraykku
    ava paranjukoduthu.
  </div>
</div>

<p class="translation">
  Human beliefs. Stories and beliefs passed down
  for thousands of years, from one generation to another.
</p>
</section>

<!-- PAGE 4 -->

<section class="page">
<h2>THE RULES</h2>

<div class="panel">
  <span class="label">PANEL 1</span>
  <div class="bubble">"Ithaanu sathyam."</div>
</div>

<div class="panel">
  <span class="label">PANEL 2</span>
  <div class="bubble">"Ithu vishwasikkanam."</div>
</div>

<div class="panel dark">
  <span class="label">PANEL 3</span>
  <div class="bubble">
    "Nammude poorvikar paranjathaanu."
  </div>
</div>

<div class="panel dark">
  <span class="label">PANEL 4</span>
  <div class="bubble">
    "Ithine chodhyam cheyyaruthu."
  </div>
</div>

<p class="translation">
  "This is the truth."
  "You must believe it."
  "Our ancestors said so."
  "Do not question it."
</p>
</section>

<!-- PAGE 5 -->

<section class="page">
<h2>MANY BELIEFS</h2>

<div class="panel wide">
  <span class="label">PANEL 1 · CROWDED STREET</span>
  <div class="caption">
    Lokath mathangal palathayirunnu.
    Pakshe ororutharum thangalude
    vishwasathe sathyamaayi karuthi.
  </div>
</div>

<div class="panel">
  <span class="label">PANEL 2 · PEOPLE</span>
  <div class="caption">
    Athil thettonnummillennu palarum karuthi.
  </div>
</div>

<div class="panel dark">
  <span class="label">PANEL 3 · SHADOWS</span>
  <div class="caption">
    Pakshe chilar…
  </div>
</div>

<p class="translation">
  The world had many religions, but people considered
  their own beliefs to be true. Many saw nothing wrong
  with that. But some…
</p>
</section>

<!-- PAGE 6 -->

<section class="page">
<h2>THE DANGER</h2>

<div class="panel dark wide">
  <span class="label">PANEL 1 · DRAMATIC SHOT</span>
  <div class="caption">
    Aa vishwasathinte peril mattullavarude
    jeevitham theerumanikkan thudangi.
  </div>
</div>

<div class="panel dark wide">
  <span class="label">PANEL 2 · TITLE REVEAL</span>
  <div class="bubble">
    WHEN EVERYONE HAD AN ANSWER…
  </div>
  <div class="caption">
    ONE MAN DARED TO ASK: WHY?
  </div>
</div>

<p class="translation">
  Some began deciding how other people should live
  in the name of belief.
</p>

<h3>END OF PROLOGUE</h3>
<p>
  Next chapter: A mysterious question emerges in
  futuristic Kerala. Who gets to decide what is true?
</p>
</section>

<div class="controls">
  <button onclick="changePage(-1)">← Previous</button>
  <span id="counter2">Page 1 / 6</span>
  <button onclick="changePage(1)">Next →</button>
</div>

</main>

<footer>
  WHY? — An original philosophical sci-fi manga
</footer>

<script>
let currentPage = 0;

const pages = document.querySelectorAll(".page");

function changePage(direction) {
  pages[currentPage].classList.remove("active");

  currentPage += direction;

  if (currentPage < 0) currentPage = 0;
  if (currentPage >= pages.length) {
    currentPage = pages.length - 1;
  }

  pages[currentPage].classList.add("active");

  document.getElementById("counter").textContent =
    `Page ${currentPage + 1} / ${pages.length}`;

  document.getElementById("counter2").textContent =
    `Page ${currentPage + 1} / ${pages.length}`;

  document.getElementById("previous").disabled =
    currentPage === 0;

  document.getElementById("next").disabled =
    currentPage === pages.length - 1;

  window.scrollTo({ top: 0, behavior: "smooth" });
}

document.addEventListener("keydown", function(event) {
  if (event.key === "ArrowRight") changePage(1);
  if (event.key === "ArrowLeft") changePage(-1);
});

changePage(0);
</script>

</body>
</html>
